OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry
OL,6,Finitially but a band of rain will
OL,7,Fquickly move in from the west. The
OL,8,Frain may turn heavy and persistent at
OL,9,Ftimes, particularly over higher ground
OL,10,Fin the south. A mild night with
OL,11,Ftemperatures staying in double figures.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FRain will clear east during
OL,14,Fthe morning, with brighter skies
OL,15,Fdeveloping by lunchtime. A scattering
OL,16,Fof showers then moving in for the
OL,17,Fafternoon, some of which maybe heavy.
OL,18,FFeeling cooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
