OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FDrier
OL,6,Fand brighter on Wednesday with spells
OL,7,Fof sunshine. Another band of rain then
OL,8,Fmoves in for Thursday, before drier
OL,9,Fand brighter weather returns on
OL,10,FFriday. Temperatures likely around
OL,11,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
